PROMPT =============================================================================
PROMPT Rules:
PROMPT   - Project Number is strongly recommended.
PROMPT   - PCF ID is strongly recommended when user gives one.
PROMPT   - Task/Product/Mark/Header/etc are optional drill-down filters.
PROMPT   - Leave optional values blank using two single quotes: ''.
PROMPT   - IMPORTANT: all optional filters below use IS NULL, never = ''.
PROMPT =============================================================================

