PROMPT =============================================================================
PROMPT 16. LB BILLING HISTORY
PROMPT =============================================================================
PROMPT PURPOSE:
PROMPT   Determine what LB billing selected for Job Cost.
PROMPT
PROMPT EXPECTATION:
PROMPT   Compare QTY to the lot/PCF physical amount and TNUM.
PROMPT
