PROMPT
PROMPT =============================================================================
PROMPT 21. PA EXPENDITURE ITEMS - FULL DOWNSTREAM STATUS
PROMPT =============================================================================
PROMPT PURPOSE:
PROMPT   Determine whether the production transaction imported and whether Cost
PROMPT   Distribution / Revenue Distribution are pending.
PROMPT
PROMPT ATTRIBUTE CONVENTION:
PROMPT   ATTRIBUTE2 = Production TNUM (Pxxxxxx)
PROMPT   ATTRIBUTE3 = PCF_ID
PROMPT   ATTRIBUTE4 = Revision
PROMPT   ATTRIBUTE5 = Vendor
PROMPT   ATTRIBUTE6 = CURRENT / PREVIOUS
PROMPT
PROMPT EXPECTATION:
PROMPT   COST_DISTRIBUTED_FLAG=N
PROMPT       -> imported to PA but Cost Distribution still pending.
PROMPT =============================================================================

SELECT
    p.segment1 AS project_number,
    pt.task_number,
    pei.expenditure_item_id,
    pei.expenditure_item_date,
    pei.expenditure_type,
    pei.quantity,
    pei.raw_cost,
    pei.denom_raw_cost,
    pei.transaction_source,
    pei.orig_transaction_reference,
    pei.attribute2 AS production_tnum,
    pei.attribute3 AS pcf_id,
    pei.attribute4 AS revision_number,
    pei.attribute5 AS vendor,
    pei.attribute6 AS period_classification,
    pei.cost_distributed_flag,
    pei.cost_dist_rejection_code,
    pei.revenue_distributed_flag,
    pei.rev_dist_rejection_code,
    pei.billable_flag,
    pei.bill_hold_flag,
    pei.revenue_hold_flag,
    pei.request_id,
    pei.creation_date
FROM apps.pa_expenditure_items_all pei
JOIN apps.pa_projects_all p
  ON p.project_id = pei.project_id
JOIN apps.pa_tasks pt
  ON pt.task_id = pei.task_id
 AND pt.project_id = pei.project_id
WHERE ('&&P_PROJECT_NUMBER' IS NULL OR p.segment1 = '&&P_PROJECT_NUMBER')
  AND ('&&P_TASK_NUMBER' IS NULL OR pt.task_number = '&&P_TASK_NUMBER')
  AND ('&&P_PCF_ID' IS NULL OR pei.attribute3 = '&&P_PCF_ID')
  AND ('&&P_REVISION' IS NULL OR pei.attribute4 = '&&P_REVISION')
  AND ('&&P_TNUM' IS NULL OR pei.attribute2 = '&&P_TNUM'
                                  OR pei.orig_transaction_reference = '&&P_TNUM')
  AND pei.expenditure_type LIKE 'PRECAST%'
ORDER BY pei.expenditure_item_date, pei.expenditure_item_id;

